## 1. Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    U([User / script]) -->|upload .png/.jpg| IN[(Blob Storage<br/>input/)]
    IN -->|BlobCreated<br/>filter: /containers/input/| EG{{Event Grid<br/>system topic}}
    EG --> D[dispatcher<br/>Event Grid trigger]
    D -->|invalid| REJ[(rejected/<br/>+ .reason.json)]
    D -->|valid: JSON message| Q[[Storage Queue<br/>inference-requests]]
    Q --> W[worker<br/>queue trigger]
    Q -. 5 failed attempts .-> PQ[[inference-requests-poison]]
    W -->|POST /predict| API[ML API – FastAPI + ONNX<br/>Container Apps 0→2 replicas]
    W --> OUT[(output/*.json)]
    W -->|upsert| DB[(Cosmos DB Free Tier<br/>pipeline/inferences)]
    DB --> R[recent<br/>HTTP GET /api/recent]
    R --> WEB[Dashboard<br/>static site $web + Chart.js]

    subgraph Function App – Flex Consumption, Python 3.12
      D
      W
      R
    end
```

Cross-cutting: **Application Insights** (OpenTelemetry, custom metrics, alert), **GitHub Actions** (CI + OIDC deployment), **managed identities** (no keys in code), **budget** with alerts.

| # | Service | Resource | Configuration |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Blob Storage | `stbcellajpipe` | Standard LRS, hot, versioning on; containers `input`, `output`, `rejected`, `models`, `$web` |
| 2 | Event Grid | `blob-to-dispatcher` | `Microsoft.Storage.BlobCreated`, subject begins with `/blobServices/default/containers/input/` |
| 3 | Storage Queue | `inference-requests` (+ `-poison`) | `maxDequeueCount = 5`, visibility timeout 10 s |
| 4 | Function App | `func-bcellaj` | Flex Consumption, Python 3.12, 512 MB, 3 functions, system-assigned identity |
| 5 | ML API | `api-bcellaj` in `cae-bcellaj` | Container Apps Consumption, 0.25 vCPU / 0.5 GiB, **min 0 / max 2 replicas**, probes on `/health` |
| 6 | Results | `output/` | full JSON result per file (with all class probabilities) |
| 7 | Cosmos DB | `cosmos-bcellaj` | **Free Tier**, database `pipeline` (400 RU/s shared), container `inferences`, partition key `/fileName` |
| 8 | Dashboard | `$web` | static HTML/JS, refresh every 30 s, CORS on `/api/recent` restricted to the site origin |
| – | Monitoring | `log-bcellaj`, `appi-bcellaj` | workspace-based App Insights, **daily cap 0.2 GB** |

