## 5. ML API (`/api`)

| Endpoint | Returns |
|---|---|
| `GET /health` | status + model loading time (liveness and readiness probes) |
| `GET /version` | API version, model version, **git SHA of the deployed commit** |
| `POST /predict` | `{"file_name", "image_base64"}` → cell type, confidence, 8 probabilities, latency |
| `GET /metrics` | number of calls, successes, errors, average latency |

- Pydantic validation (invalid base64, oversized image, missing field, missing body → **422**); 9 pytest tests.
- Multi-stage Dockerfile on `python:3.12-slim`, non-root user (uid 10001), `HEALTHCHECK`, ONNX Runtime instead of PyTorch → small image.
- Configuration through environment variables only; the Application Insights connection string is a **Container Apps secret**.
- Telemetry: `azure-monitor-opentelemetry` + custom metrics `inferences_total`, `model_latency_ms`, `prediction_errors_total`.

